[en.FOCUS_C12_OPENLY_DEFY_THE_EMPIRE]
Openly Defy The Empire

[en.FOCUS_C12_OPENLY_DEFY_THE_EMPIRE_desc]
The rock farm is no longer what it once was. I have made preliminary preparations for war. At the very least, we no longer need to bribe various imperial officials and pay heavy taxes to keep a low profile. These funds should be invested in building more weapons, rather than obediently handing them over to the empire.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_OPENLY_DEFY_THE_EMPIRE]
公然触逆帝国

[zh.FOCUS_C12_OPENLY_DEFY_THE_EMPIRE_desc]
采石农场已不复往昔，我已经做好了初步开战的准备，至少，现在不再需要贿赂不同的帝国官员和缴纳大量赋税来保持低调，这些资金该用来投资建造更多的武器，而不是乖乖将其交给帝国

